WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.880
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this week
on the Supernatural finale the mother of all

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.090
cliffhangers went down.

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:10.210
And as crazy as it is to think, Season 10
is going to be one of the most interesting

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.660
years they show has ever had.

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:16.289
Metatron even gave one of the best ideas for
a new Supernatural spinoff I’ve heard in

00:00:16.289 --> 00:00:17.530
a long time.

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:19.040
If you’re finding me for the first time.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:24.170
I do all kinds of sci fi and fantasy videos
for shows like Supernatural, Game of Thrones

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:25.170
and Marvel.

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.840
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:32.380
And feel free to suggest topics for bonus
videos while Team Winchester is on hiatus.

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:33.380
Time to get Winchestered.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:35.859
That’s not a sex thing by the way.

00:00:35.859 --> 00:00:40.579
I’m going to start with my top 5 moments
and then do my review.

00:00:40.579 --> 00:00:43.440
Careful for spoilers from the episode if you
haven’t seen it yet.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:44.440
Here we go.

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:47.350
Number 5 - Metatron edges out PewdiePie as
the world biggest Youtube Star

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:50.600
It’s actually a pretty ingenious plan.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:54.519
If you wanted people to starting thinking
you were god you’d have to use a social

00:00:54.519 --> 00:00:58.389
media platform to reach as many eyeballs as
quickly as possible.

00:00:58.389 --> 00:01:01.800
And Youtube is the world’s biggest social
media site.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:03.170
People just forget that because it’s video.

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:04.170
But it’s really a social media tool at it’s
core.

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:08.570
I always thought it was human souls that made
angels more powerful, like when Castiel became

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:09.570
god.

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:13.390
He didn’t literally become god, he just
became so powerful he was LIKE god.

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:15.360
And the same is true of Metatron.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:18.549
He’s just tapping into the energy of the
Angel Tablet.

00:01:18.549 --> 00:01:21.969
That’s why he said that phrase when he was
punching Dean’s lights out.

00:01:21.969 --> 00:01:27.100
He was comparing the benefits of being powered
by the word of god, the tablet, versus being

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:28.690
powered by the first blade.

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:32.479
Obviously the word of god is going to be more
powerful, because it’s literally the words

00:01:32.479 --> 00:01:33.720
of creation.

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:36.719
I love the idea that he was storing it inside
his typewriter.

00:01:36.719 --> 00:01:40.159
I’m guessing he was just translating it
into readable words.

00:01:40.159 --> 00:01:44.540
And that was the story he was writing, the
best story ever.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:48.280
He also spent a lot of time talking to Castiel
this season about how the best artists steal

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:49.280
their material.

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:52.640
Which is funny, because he was essentially
ripping of God, via the tablet.

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:55.140
To write his new story.

00:01:55.140 --> 00:02:00.170
He’s still alive, so hopefully in season
10 we’ll learn more about what his story

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:02.079
was going to be.

00:02:02.079 --> 00:02:06.819
It’s almost like George RR Martin teasing
out winds of winter on his blog.

00:02:06.819 --> 00:02:11.220
Maybe that’s what Metatron will do in season
10.

00:02:11.220 --> 00:02:15.470
Number 4 - Castiel Uses Pop Culture To Defeat
Metatron

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:19.690
Getting the villain to monologue while you
secretly broadcast him to the whole school

00:02:19.690 --> 00:02:21.550
is an oldie but a goodie.

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:25.520
When Metatron told Castiel he should have
read more he was forgetting that he implanted

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:29.670
the sum total of all pop culture that had
ever existed in his brain.

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:34.660
Remember, Metatron basically copy and pasted
his brain into Castiel.

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:37.751
And Metatron had read every book that had
ever been written, seen every movie that had

00:02:37.751 --> 00:02:41.450
ever been made, et cetera.

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:43.550
So in a way, Metatron defeated himself.

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:46.340
I don’t think Castiel would have thought
to do that otherwise.

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:50.380
And now that he’s defeated him, Castiel
is the reluctant leader again.

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:54.250
When Hannah asked him about his Grace I actually
thought he was going to ‘borrow’ Dean

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:57.040
to heal himself like Gadreel did at the beginning
of the Season.

00:02:57.040 --> 00:03:00.600
I’ll talk about Castiel Season 10 after
my review.

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:07.120
One of my favorite take aways from this scene
was that Castiel broke the most powerful weapon

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:11.540
in the universe to save one man.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:15.260
Destiel shippers probably exploded in front
of their tvs.

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:18.470
Number 3 - Crowley Is Getting Restless In
Hell

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:22.260
This all ties into that speech in the diner
where he gets all existential on Dean and

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:25.780
makes him wonder if there’s anything more
for him beyond hunting.

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:29.250
Now that we’ve seen the whole episode, I
kind of think he was foreshadowing Dean becoming

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:30.250
a Demon.

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:34.390
Like Crowley himself was also getting tired
of his daily grind and was just waiting for

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:38.470
Dean to die so the mark would resurrect him
as a demon and they could go on new adventures

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:40.700
together as a pair of demons.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:43.530
Like Crowley thought he’d replace Sam in
Dean’s life.

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:48.750
As much as Sam made fun of Dean for his bromance
with Crowley, I think Crowley actually really

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:50.020
enjoys having Dean around.

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:51.020
Eternity is boring.

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:55.450
For any Batman fans out there, Ra’s Al Ghul
actually said in the comics once, Memory is

00:03:55.450 --> 00:04:03.100
the first casualty of Immortality, I would
say excitement is the second.

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:06.100
Dean turning is like the best thing that could
have happened to Crowley.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.400
It creates is own set of unique problems.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:10.810
But we can talk about that after my review.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:13.110
Number 2 - Dean Dies

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:16.931
I always knew one of them would sacrifice
themselves at the end of this season, and

00:04:16.931 --> 00:04:18.560
given last year it was Sam’s turn.

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:21.510
It only makes sense that Dean gets his wish
and dies.

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:23.120
Well, not exactly.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:28.910
We won’t know what his reaction to being
a demon is till episode 1 of season 10.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:33.390
But up to that point I think Dean was just
happy to be rid of his blade addiction.

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:38.570
He’d really strained his relationship with
Sam, and you guys can let me know what you

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:48.940
thought of the addict storyline, but I think
there’s this idea that you never really

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:51.230
stop being an addict.

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:56.660
Like the drugs never really let you go.

00:04:56.660 --> 00:05:02.970
And thus Dean can’t die, not a true death.

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:07.000
and my Number 1 moment - Dean Becomes A Demon

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:10.720
Of all the possible resolutions to the season,
this was one of the best.

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:14.890
I can’t wait to see Dean embrace some of
his more destructive tendencies.

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:18.550
Being that he’s a Demon he’ll still have
his old personality.

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:22.500
Think about Cain, he had the mark and when
we first met him, he seemed pretty normal.

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:27.040
So I’m expecting Dean to still tell the
same jokes and still go for burgers and women.

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:31.420
He’ll just have some Demon urges lumped
on top of all his other vices.

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:37.310
The real question now is how can Sam and Castiel
fix him, or at least bring him into heaven.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:39.080
Is that even possible?

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:46.480
I think it is, but it’s going to be the
larger Season 10 arc in addition to Castiel

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:47.480
fixing heaven.

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:48.900
That will mean fixing the tablet.

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:50.560
Which only a prophet can do.

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:52.330
I wonder if that means we’ll get to see
Kevin again?

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.860
Even though he’s a ghost.

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:57.000
But now it’s your turn, let me know in the
comments what your favorite moment was?

00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:02.240
And do you think they’ll be able to save
Dean or will he just live forever as a Demon?

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:04.620
Wouldn’t that be a crazy way for them to
end the series.

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:08.540
With Sam becoming the vessel for an angel
and living forever in heaven and Dean living

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:10.389
forever in Hell as a Demon.

00:06:10.389 --> 00:06:14.160
I don’t actually think that’s what’s
going to happen.

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:18.410
Here’s a few of my favorite one liners from
the episode:

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:22.740
The best was Metatron saying winning a People’s
Choice Award.

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:24.570
Not quite the real thing.”

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:28.840
It was a burn against Jensen Ackles and Jared
Paladecki who have won a bunch of People’s

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:30.840
Choice Awards, but never an Emmy.

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:36.080
Although Supernatural as a series has been
nominated for two emmys.

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:38.290
Dean saying, “Hell isn’t complicated.

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:43.450
Game of Thrones and Shower Sex are complicated”
Everyone on staff must really like Game of

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:44.450
Thrones.

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:52.120
I’ve heard more references to it than any
other tv show this season.

00:06:52.120 --> 00:07:00.240
Crowley saying, “I guess I’ve been Winchestered”

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:03.660
Metatron saying “They Love me, they really
love me.”

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:08.020
In case you didn’t know Sally Field said
that line after winning back to back Oscars

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:10.320
for movies she had done a long long time ago.

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:11.389
People started making fun of her by putting
it in movies and tv shows.

00:07:11.389 --> 00:07:13.880
Jim Carrey said it in The Mask, but you hear
the line all the time all over TV.

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:16.150
Then when Metatron says “Locked Up Abroad
Heaven” Edition.

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:19.350
It’s a reference to the tv series An Idiot
Abroad.

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:24.360
It’s a comedy travel show where Ricky Gervias,
Stephen Merchant and Warwick Davis send a

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:27.510
really dumb person to travel around visiting
places and being silly.

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:29.390
The show is a parody itself.

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:32.430
So Metatron is parodying a parody.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:35.419
And that is why I love Supernatural.

00:07:35.419 --> 00:07:39.290
Overall just comparing this episode to other
Supernatural episodes and finales I’d say

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:41.000
was definitely in my top 3.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:44.460
I still feel like the season 5 finale was
the best.

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:48.530
Just because that was really meant to end
the series.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:51.790
They didn’t know they were picked up for
season 6 until after they shot it.

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.010
So it was a real deal ending to the show.

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:57.479
You really have to look at Supernatural a
little different than other shows because

00:07:57.479 --> 00:08:00.930
it’s been going on for almost 10 years,
which is amazing.

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:03.500
Especially that it’s sustained its popularity.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:07.790
To that end we really have to get credit to
the characters for being so strong.

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:13.130
This year my favorite was definitely Metatron,
Curtis Armstrong did an interview with Chris

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:18.430
Hardwick at Nerdist where he said he still
can’t get cast in a pilot to save his life.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:24.660
But I feel like he’s really show how awesome
he can be as the Metatron character.

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:28.510
He really did make for one of my favorite
all time Supernatural villains.

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:33.449
And because the writers used the conceit of
Metatron being a scribe and writing the greatest

00:08:33.449 --> 00:08:34.449
story ever written.

00:08:34.449 --> 00:08:37.779
It gave them the opportunity to go nuts with
Pop Culture jokes.

00:08:37.779 --> 00:08:42.159
Which also became a backdoor to change Castiel
on a fundamental level.

00:08:42.159 --> 00:08:44.850
Now Castiel gets all the jokes.

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:48.110
Even though he’s not a tv junkie, his brain
contains all that knowledge now.

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:52.360
I wasn’t as happy with Sam’s arc as I
was with Dean and the Mark of Cain, but he

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:54.649
has all of next year to sacrifice himself
again to save Dean’s soul.

00:08:54.649 --> 00:08:55.649
If that’s even possible.

00:08:55.649 --> 00:09:00.089
As silly as it is sometimes, I totally think
Supernatural earns all it’s moments.

00:09:00.089 --> 00:09:04.920
Like the ridiculousness all comes from a very
logical place inside the universe it’s created

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:05.920
for itself.

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:09.519
So there were never really any plot twists
or character arcs I felt were out of place

00:09:09.519 --> 00:09:10.519
or lame.

00:09:10.519 --> 00:09:12.150
But here’s where we can talk a little Season
10.

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:13.150
Let’s stick to the big stuff.

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:15.290
Castiel in Heaven and Dean as a Demon.

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:20.050
So Castiel has to finish fixing heaven, because
even though he knows where the entrance is,

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:22.370
there are still a bunch of wayward angels
on earth.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:25.189
And I think it’s going to involve repairing
the tablet.

00:09:25.189 --> 00:09:29.999
They can be repaired, but only by the prophet
meant to read them.

00:09:29.999 --> 00:09:32.839
Which means Castiel will probably need Metatron’s
help.

00:09:32.839 --> 00:09:35.750
Who is currently rotting in Heaven’s prison.

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:37.000
Then there’s Dean and Crowley.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:40.889
Dean is a demon now, he still has the mark
of cain and the first blade.

00:09:40.889 --> 00:09:43.470
So he’ll have a little more power over his
urges to kill.

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:45.649
But he’ll still be a threat to Crowley.

00:09:45.649 --> 00:09:49.800
I like the idea that Dean might make a play
for the Throne of Hell by using the first

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:50.949
blade on Crowley.

00:09:50.949 --> 00:09:54.630
But I don’t see the series ending with Dean
becoming the King of Hell.

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:57.579
That’s just a nice fantasy that I’ll let
tumblr explore.

00:09:57.579 --> 00:10:02.730
What I do expect is that the Brothers will
be reunited in an unusual way.

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:04.450
Like they’ll end up together.

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.360
But I expect there to be some weird twist.

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:09.179
I fully expect Castiel to survive all of this
intact too.

00:10:09.179 --> 00:10:10.619
His Grace will be restored.

00:10:10.619 --> 00:10:15.000
I don’t want to make too many predictions
before they start teasing us with actual details

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.529
for season 10 episodes.

00:10:16.529 --> 00:10:19.829
But I’ll bet they drop some bombs at Comic
Con this summer.

00:10:19.829 --> 00:10:22.180
So i’ll be sure to do another video when
we get more info.

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:26.199
In related news, if there’s any special
supernatural bonus videos you want me to do

00:10:26.199 --> 00:10:29.079
this summer, just let me know in the comments
and I’ll add them to my list.

00:10:29.079 --> 00:10:31.879
Tuesdays are typically going to be Marvel/Star
Wars days though.

00:10:31.879 --> 00:10:34.139
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:10:34.139 --> 00:10:39.199
Right now click here for all my Supernatural
videos and click here for the new Guardians

00:10:39.199 --> 00:10:40.199
of The Galaxy Trailer.

00:10:40.199 --> 00:10:42.559
High fives everybody, You’ve just been winchestered.

00:10:42.559 --> 00:10:43.639
See you tomorrow!

